<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb (from adjective)</strong></div>
    <div>adjective + <strong>de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">快<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">地</span></div>
    <div class="col">kuài de</div>
    <div class="col">Quickly</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb (from adjective or noun)</strong></div>
    <div>adjective / noun + <strong>shang</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">快<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">上</span></div>
    <div class="col">kuài shang</div>
    <div class="col">Quickly</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb of time</strong></div>
    <div>subject + verb + <strong>time adverb</strong> + verb + object-de</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫是<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">昨天</span>喝牛奶的</div>
    <div>māo shì zuótiān hē niúnǎi de</div>
    <div>It was yesterday that the cat drank the milk</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb of time length (duration)</strong></div>
    <div>subject + verb + <strong>time length adverb</strong>-de + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫喝<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">两个小时</span>的牛奶</div>
    <div>māo hē liǎng-ge xiǎoshí de niúnǎi</div>
    <div>The cat drinks milk for two hours</div>
    <div>subject + verb + object + verb + <strong>time length adverb</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫喝牛奶喝<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">两个小时</span></div>
    <div>māo hē niúnǎi hē liǎng-ge xiǎoshí</div>
    <div>The cat drinks milk for two hours</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb of time and place</strong></div>
    <div>subject + <strong>time adverb</strong> + <strong>place adverb</strong> + verb + object</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">今天在</span>家里喝牛奶</div>
    <div>māo jīntiān zài jiā-li hē niúnǎi</div>
    <div>The cat drinks the milk in the house today</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb of time and place (emphasis)</strong></div>
    <div><strong>shì</strong> + place/time adverb-[past] + <strong>de</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">是...的</div>
</div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Adverb</strong></div>
    <div><strong>adverb</strong> + verb</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">我<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">很</span>喜欢喝牛奶</div>
    <div>wǒ hěn xǐhuan hē niúnǎi</div>
    <div>I like drinking milk</div>
</div>
